# Derived by hand from the Bible's recorded transcript of the same test on the same library (prism-notes, claude/04-domains-and-documents/evidence/documents/tests.expected, test accepted), with this version's four buttons (the table at position 5) and its one `compute` before the click: the views' first answers are told at tick 2 as there, the click is tick 2's input, and by Semantics ch. 9 (a request at n is answered at n+1) the response and the new total are told at tick 3. The run on the gen1 f24a (fix ce1b0a05) gives these bytes.
test accepted

